Near miss for comment_text_after_terminator (issue #304): a multi-line
comment is followed by an assignment to a variable whose name is an SSL
keyword name (`label`). An identifier followed by `:=` is a statement,
not a stranded header line. Clean of comment findings.
-- input.ssl --
:PROCEDURE ReadLabel;
	:DECLARE label;
	/* collect the request values
	before they are parsed;
	label := Upper("draft");
	:RETURN label;
:ENDPROC;
-- format --
